    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FASTEN SEAT BELT\nRELEASE SEAT BELT\nNORTHWEST\nFor your safety we recommend you keep your seat belt fastened while you are seated.\nTAKE OFF \u0026 LANDING\n747-400\nSAFETY\nFEATURES\nDo Not Remove\nFrom Aircraft\nBRACE POSITIONS",
      "OXYGEN MASK\nQuickly pull mask to activate oxygen flow. The bag will not fully inflate. Tighten mask for a secure fit.\nDOOR EXIT A\nDOOR EXIT B\nEVACUATION SLIDE\nEMERGENCY\nPATH\nLIGHTS\nRed lights are\ngrouped at\nEmergency Exits\nLAND EVACUATION",
      "LIFE VEST\nWATER EVACUATION\nUse main deck doors only.\n00-0410-3-3110"
    ],
